kOS Improved (kOSIM) — independent fork of kOS

Fork source and releases: https://github.com/Jvaxx/kOSIm
User manual source: https://github.com/Jvaxx/kOSIm/tree/master/doc
Upstream language manual (not fork-specific UI help): https://ksp-kos.github.io/KOS_DOC/

Originally created by Kevin Laity (Nivekk): https://github.com/Nivekk/KOS
Developed by the upstream kOS team and contributors: https://github.com/KSP-KOS/KOS
Fork source baseline: upstream kOS 1.6.0.1; exact provenance is in kOS.props.
Distributed under GNU GPL v3; retain original licenses, credits and notices.

This replaces upstream kOS; do not install both. Keep GameData/kOS and preserve
Plugins/PluginData when updating. ModuleManager is required. The fork's CKAN
identifier is kOSImproved; it provides kOS to add-ons and conflicts with upstream
kOS. Remove a CKAN-installed upstream kOS before installing it. Back up saves,
scripts and configuration before changing installations.

Licenses: LICENSE.md (GNU GPL v3), THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and Licenses/.
Corresponding source for this build: SOURCE.txt.

Runtime validation: Windows KSP 1.12.5.3190 under GE-Proton11-7 on Linux only.
Report fork bugs to https://github.com/Jvaxx/kOSIm/issues, not upstream.
